Package 107: boot Servo On per golden for non-1203 axes (HT9050's axes are all 1203: unchanged here), boot
GetHotPlateYHalfPos, fMotorTest null guard, web control token (newest screen wins), St02 testercomm shared panel /
W58 (SIM only), ELA_Ftp link fix. Its 10 tools/vscode-htdesigner files (HTDESIGNER 0.143) are NOT here: the designer
session merges them itself.
C++ tree: NEW 10, OLD (machine had an older laptop version, taken as is), LOCAL 2 merged three-way on the package's own
base with no conflict and no merge-duplicated line: Motor/mymotor.cpp (the machine's HT9050-ORG-ENG lines kept, 3/3)
and tools/wb_serve.cpp. Line endings: the package arrived LF; every file is stored with the line endings it had in HEAD
(new files CRLF), so the diff is content only. o2: wb_serve + 7 tests build, PE 38/38; ctest Boot_ServoOn / SimNet_Mask /
SimNet_Write / TesterComm_HomeJson / ELA_Schedule / WebMotorAccess / VacuumVc8 / MachineIoTable_HT9050 / IoPoints_HT9050 /
MachineSuckers_HT9050 pass; production_audit unchanged.

